    {"id":"model-vs-parameter","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-02","context_id":"overview-chunking-comparison","question":"切片模型和切片参数差在哪里？","aliases":["chunk size是切片模型吗"],"keywords":["切片模型","切片参数","chunk size"],"diagnostic":"区分边界算法和尺度设置。","hints":["查看 #overview-chunking-comparison。","先选边界再调尺度。"],"example":"fixed是模型，size是参数。","answer":"模型决定在哪里断开，参数控制窗口、重叠或阈值等尺度。","source":{"label":"切片对照","href":"#overview-chunking-comparison"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"fixed-window","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-02","context_id":"concept-five-chunkers","question":"固定窗口切片适合做什么？","aliases":["fixed chunk的主要风险是什么"],"keywords":["固定窗口切片","fixed chunk","风险"],"diagnostic":"权衡稳定基线与语义截断。","hints":["查看 #concept-five-chunkers。","先作为可复现基线。"],"example":"size=18 overlap=4。","answer":"适合简单稳定基线；主要风险是在字符边界截断句子或结构。","source":{"label":"五种Chunker","href":"#concept-five-chunkers"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"recursive-chunk","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-02","context_id":"concept-five-chunkers","question":"递归切片怎样选择边界？","aliases":["recursive separator有什么用"],"keywords":["递归切片","边界","recursive separator"],"diagnostic":"检查段落、句子和空格优先级。","hints":["查看 #concept-five-chunkers。","验证中文分隔符。"],"example":"段落→换行→句号→空格。","answer":"在最大长度内按分隔优先级寻找最近自然边界，找不到才退化。","source":{"label":"五种Chunker","href":"#concept-five-chunkers"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"structure-aware","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-02","context_id":"concept-five-chunkers","question":"标题页码感知切片保留什么？","aliases":["结构切片为什么适合文档"],"keywords":["标题页码感知","结构切片","文档"],"diagnostic":"检查heading path和page继承。","hints":["查看 #concept-five-chunkers。","超长章节仍需二次切分。"],"example":"Guide/Setup,page 3。","answer":"保留章节路径、页码和块边界，使检索与引用能恢复文档结构。","source":{"label":"五种Chunker","href":"#concept-five-chunkers"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"semantic-breakpoint","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-02","context_id":"concept-five-chunkers","question":"语义断点切片怎样工作？","aliases":["相邻句向量距离怎么切片"],"keywords":["语义断点切片","相邻句","向量距离"],"diagnostic":"检查adapter、距离和threshold身份。","hints":["查看 #concept-five-chunkers。","固定模型版本和阈值。"],"example":"distance大于阈值时断开。","answer":"比较相邻句向量距离，超过固定阈值时形成新chunk。","source":{"label":"五种Chunker","href":"#concept-five-chunkers"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"parent-child","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-02","context_id":"example-parent-child-citation","question":"父子切片怎样兼顾召回和上下文？","aliases":["child命中后为什么回填parent"],"keywords":["父子切片","召回","上下文","回填parent"],"diagnostic":"区分小块命中和大块阅读。","hints":["查看 #example-parent-child-citation。","引用仍指child精确区间。"],"example":"child retrieve,parent context。","answer":"用小child提高召回精度，命中后回填parent提供完整语境。","source":{"label":"父子切片引用","href":"#example-parent-child-citation"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"citation-coordinate","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-02","context_id":"example-parent-child-citation","question":"父块回填后引用应该指哪里？","aliases":["能把整个parent当证据吗"],"keywords":["父块回填","引用","parent","证据"],"diagnostic":"检查支持claim的精确原文区间。","hints":["查看 #example-parent-child-citation。","保留child block/start/end。"],"example":"citation指child。","answer":"引用仍指实际支持claim的child原文坐标，不能把整个parent都声明为证据。","source":{"label":"父子切片引用","href":"#example-parent-child-citation"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"strategy-version","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-02","context_id":"concept-strategy-identity-metrics","question":"切片策略版本要包含哪些信息？","aliases":["改chunk size要换版本吗"],"keywords":["切片策略版本","chunk size","换版本"],"diagnostic":"检查模型、参数和adapter身份。","hints":["查看 #concept-strategy-identity-metrics。","参数变化不能覆盖旧报告。"],"example":"fixed-v1:size=18:overlap=4。","answer":"包含模型版本和size、overlap、threshold、adapter等关键参数；变化就形成新身份。","source":{"label":"策略身份与指标","href":"#concept-strategy-identity-metrics"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"four-metrics","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-02","context_id":"concept-strategy-identity-metrics","question":"切片策略要比较哪些指标？","aliases":["只看平均chunk长度够吗"],"keywords":["切片策略","指标","平均chunk长度"],"diagnostic":"补齐边界、精度、分布和重复。","hints":["查看 #concept-strategy-identity-metrics。","必须使用同一评估集。"],"example":"boundary/context/size/duplicate。","answer":"至少比较边界覆盖、上下文精度、尺寸分布和重复率。","source":{"label":"策略身份与指标","href":"#concept-strategy-identity-metrics"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
    {"id":"duplicate-rate","lesson_id":"rag-application-engineering-02","context_id":"troubleshoot-chunking-strategy","question":"切片重复率为什么会升高？","aliases":["overlap太大会怎样"],"keywords":["切片重复率","overlap","升高"],"diagnostic":"检查重叠和parent回填去重。","hints":["查看 #troubleshoot-chunking-strategy。","统计坐标覆盖重复。"],"example":"同一字符进入多个chunk。","answer":"overlap过大或父子候选未去重会重复同一原文，挤占检索和上下文预算。","source":{"label":"切片策略排错","href":"#troubleshoot-chunking-strategy"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
